<title>USA: TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE SUNDAY.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-MEN'S RESULTS IN SAN JOSE SUNDAY.</headline>
<dateline>SAN JOSE, California 1997-02-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$303,000 Sybase Open tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Singles finals:</p>
<p>1-Pete Sampras (U.S.) beat 7-Greg Rusedski (Britain) 3-6 5-0</p>
<p>ret.</p>
</text>
